1
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:06,930
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

2
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:06,930
Just like the cruel angel

3
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:14,590
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

4
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:14,590
Young boy, become a legend

5
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:22,410
2D4U PRESENTS:

6
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,810
Aoi kaze ga ima

7
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,810
Even though the untested breeze...

8
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:29,510
mune no doa o tataitemo

9
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:29,510
...taps at the door to your heart

10
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:36,970
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

11
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:36,970
You just look solely at me and smile

12
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:44,500
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

13
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:44,500
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

14
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:51,400
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

15
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:51,400
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

16
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,750
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

17
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,750
But someday, you are sure to realize...

18
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,340
sono senaka ni wa

19
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,340
...that upon your back

20
00:00:59,510 --> 00:01:02,960
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

21
00:00:59,510 --> 00:01:02,960
You have the wings with which to fly...

22
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:06,310
no hane ga aru koto

23
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:06,310
...towards the distant future

24
00:01:06,990 --> 00:01:10,690
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

25
00:01:06,990 --> 00:01:10,690
The cruel angel's thesis

26
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:14,430
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

27
00:01:10,690 --> 00:01:14,430
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

28
00:01:14,430 --> 00:01:18,200
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

29
00:01:14,430 --> 00:01:18,200
With your torrent of ardent pathos

30
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,900
Omoide o uragiru nara

31
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,900
If you are to betray our memories

32
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:25,540
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

33
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:25,540
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

34
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:29,270
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

35
00:01:25,540 --> 00:01:29,270
Young boy, become a legend

36
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:38,620
It's eating the Angel?

37
00:01:56,470 --> 00:02:00,600
And now those bindings are being undone
by the Eva's own might.

38
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:03,640
We can no longer stop the Eva.

39
00:02:05,980 --> 00:02:08,730
Unit 01's been awakened and set free.

40
00:02:08,730 --> 00:02:11,400
Seele won't stay quiet for this.

41
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:16,900
The Eva series aren't capable of
generating S2 engines themselves.

42
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:20,160
We never imagined it would take one
into itself this way.

43
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:24,790
This incident is at extreme odds with our script.

44
00:02:24,790 --> 00:02:26,790
It will not be easy to correct for this.

45
00:02:26,790 --> 00:02:32,040
Were we not mistaken to have entrusted Nerv
to Gendo Ikari in the first place?

46
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:37,010
But without that man, we could not have
executed all of our plans.

47
00:02:37,010 --> 00:02:40,090
Ikari, what are you thinking?

48
00:02:40,090 --> 00:02:41,470
It's begun, hasn't it?

49
00:02:41,470 --> 00:02:44,140
Yes, it all begins here.

50
00:02:44,180 --> 00:02:47,140
FORM OF THE MIND
FORM OF THE MAN

51
00:02:44,180 --> 00:02:47,140
EPISODE 20

52
00:02:49,190 --> 00:02:53,270
Damage on both Eva units
is beyond the Hayflick Limit.

53
00:02:53,270 --> 00:02:56,780
It'll take time before everything
goes back to normal.

54
00:02:56,780 --> 00:02:59,780
Fortunately, the Magi System can be transferred.

55
00:03:00,410 --> 00:03:02,490
We'll start working on that as early as tomorrow.

56
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:04,910
But this place will have to be scrapped.

57
00:03:04,910 --> 00:03:07,620
It's just a matter of time before
the brass decides to abandon it.

58
00:03:07,620 --> 00:03:09,000
That's true.

59
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:13,170
For the time being, we'll have to use
the backup Secondary Control Center.

60
00:03:13,170 --> 00:03:15,340
You mean, even without the Magi?

61
00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:16,840
That's right.

62
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:19,970
We'll dust it off and be working again
by this afternoon.

63
00:03:19,970 --> 00:03:22,430
But these chairs are hard, and the sensors
haven't been broken in,

64
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:24,390
so it's difficult to work here.

65
00:03:24,390 --> 00:03:27,680
Even though the layout is the same as
the control center we're familiar with.

66
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:29,310
It just doesn't feel right, you know?

67
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:31,270
At least we can use this place.

68
00:03:32,100 --> 00:03:34,810
But what we don't know is whether
we can still use Unit 01.

69
00:03:40,950 --> 00:03:43,870
Restrained by the cage... are you sure it's safe?

70
00:03:43,870 --> 00:03:48,790
No internal thermal, electron, electromagnetic,
or chemical energy readings are being detected.

71
00:03:48,790 --> 00:03:51,040
The S2 engine is completely inactive.

72
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:54,710
Nevertheless, under those conditions, Unit 01
has moved on three separate occasions.

73
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:02,550
You can't treat it carelessly based only
on what we can see and measure.

74
00:04:02,550 --> 00:04:05,850
We don't know what it'll do if
we meddle with it carelessly.

75
00:04:05,850 --> 00:04:07,720
Just like you, Miss Katsuragi.

76
00:04:11,390 --> 00:04:13,060
I'm sorry.

77
00:04:13,060 --> 00:04:16,360
However, our concerns are not
limited to Unit 01.

78
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:19,280
Correct. Serious damage was sustained
by Units 00 and 02.

79
00:04:19,280 --> 00:04:22,950
Headquarters was partially destroyed,
Central Dogma exposed.

80
00:04:22,950 --> 00:04:24,700
The damages are enormous.

81
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:28,910
We can't even estimate how much
money and time we've lost.

82
00:04:28,910 --> 00:04:31,830
All this is because we didn't put
a bell around Ikari's neck.

83
00:04:31,830 --> 00:04:34,620
There is a bell, it just didn't ring.

84
00:04:34,620 --> 00:04:36,750
A bell that doesn't ring serves no purpose.

85
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:39,170
We'll have the bell take action next time.

86
00:04:39,170 --> 00:04:42,300
My, my, what an unexpected turn of events.

87
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:48,640
The committee... I mean, how do you
intend to explain this to Seele?

88
00:04:48,640 --> 00:04:52,270
Unit 01 wasn't under our control.

89
00:04:52,270 --> 00:04:54,390
This was an unexpected accident.

90
00:04:54,390 --> 00:04:58,400
Therefore Unit 01 will stay frozen until
the Committee gives us further orders.

91
00:04:58,400 --> 00:05:00,230
That's a very appropriate decision.

92
00:05:00,230 --> 00:05:03,280
However, is your son still trapped inside it?

93
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:09,580
As expected, it's not working. The code to
eject the entry plug isn't being accepted.

94
00:05:09,580 --> 00:05:11,080
What about the backup and dummy signals?

95
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:14,160
They're being refused. We can't open
a direct circuit either.

96
00:05:14,540 --> 00:05:16,960
We've connected to the plug's video monitor.

97
00:05:16,960 --> 00:05:18,080
Switching to the main monitor.

98
00:05:20,460 --> 00:05:21,880
What in the hell is this?

99
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:25,720
This is the truth behind the 400% synch rate.

100
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:28,970
I can't believe it. What in the world
happened to Shinji?

101
00:05:28,970 --> 00:05:31,350
He's been taken into Eva Unit 01.

102
00:05:31,350 --> 00:05:34,310
What does that mean?! Just what is an Eva?!

103
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:37,770
It is something created by man
in man's own image.

104
00:05:37,770 --> 00:05:39,190
I really can't describe it any other way.

105
00:05:39,190 --> 00:05:40,900
Something created by man?

106
00:05:41,230 --> 00:05:44,990
Didn't you just copy what you found then
at the South Pole?

107
00:05:44,990 --> 00:05:46,820
I'm sure the original would be
appalled to hear this.

108
00:05:46,820 --> 00:05:50,740
This is not just a copy, because
it is imbued with a human will.

109
00:05:50,740 --> 00:05:52,830
Are you saying somebody
willed this to happen as well?!

110
00:05:52,830 --> 00:05:54,370
It could be the Eva's...

111
00:05:55,710 --> 00:05:57,460
Do something, damn you!

112
00:05:57,460 --> 00:06:00,540
You created it, didn't you?!
Take responsibility for it!

113
00:06:03,550 --> 00:06:06,090
<i><i>On the issue of the Nansa Islands,</i></i>

114
00:06:06,090 --> 00:06:09,050
<i><i>the government has officially announced
there is no federal involvement.</i></i>

115
00:06:09,050 --> 00:06:14,520
<i><i>In other news, it has been a month
since the terrorist act in Tokyo-2,</i></i>

116
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:18,060
<i><i>and the government has passed
new legislation to prevent another.</i></i>

117
00:06:16,850 --> 00:06:18,060
I'm still alive.

118
00:06:19,850 --> 00:06:23,070
I got that she made it, okay?!

119
00:06:23,070 --> 00:06:26,900
Damn it, Misato, don't keep calling me
over every little thing!

120
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:33,830
To think... to think I couldn't do anything!

121
00:06:33,830 --> 00:06:36,500
I can't believe I lost to that stupid Shinji!

122
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:39,370
I hate this!

123
00:06:41,130 --> 00:06:43,540
A plan to salvage Shinji?

124
00:06:43,540 --> 00:06:47,550
That's right. That which can be called
Shinji's life still exists.

125
00:06:47,550 --> 00:06:49,590
Now you're respecting human life?

126
00:06:49,590 --> 00:06:51,970
We can't afford to lose Shinji right now.

127
00:06:51,970 --> 00:06:53,140
Well, I wonder?

128
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:57,770
Isn't what Nerv wants not Shinji's life,
but Unit 01 as its tool?

129
00:06:57,770 --> 00:07:00,140
I won't deny it.

130
00:07:00,140 --> 00:07:03,440
We can surmise that Shinji's body
lost its ego border,

131
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:07,400
and he's floating in the entry plug
in quantum form.

132
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:12,370
In other words, Shinji has shifted
into a form we can't see?

133
00:07:12,370 --> 00:07:15,530
Yes, the composition of the LCL inside the plug
has chemically altered

134
00:07:15,530 --> 00:07:20,250
into something very similar to the
sea water of primitive Earth.

135
00:07:20,250 --> 00:07:22,040
A soup of life, huh?

136
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:26,300
All of the substances which composed Shinji
are still preserved in the plug,

137
00:07:26,300 --> 00:07:29,170
and what could be called his soul
exists there as well.

138
00:07:29,170 --> 00:07:33,430
In fact, his self-image is pseudo-
substantiating his plug suit.

139
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:35,010
In other words, salvaging him means

140
00:07:35,010 --> 00:07:39,020
reconstructing his body and
anchoring his psyche within it.

141
00:07:39,020 --> 00:07:40,600
Is that possible?

142
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:42,140
With the Magi's support, yes.

143
00:07:42,140 --> 00:07:44,520
Theoretically, right?

144
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:46,940
You can't know what will happen until you try it.

145
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:53,320
What is this?

146
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,910
Where am I?

147
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,990
In the entry plug?

148
00:07:56,990 --> 00:07:58,700
In Unit 01?

149
00:07:58,700 --> 00:08:01,500
But there's nobody here. I'm not even here.

150
00:08:01,660 --> 00:08:05,130
What is this? What is this? What is this?

151
00:08:05,170 --> 00:08:06,670
I don't really understand.

152
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:09,420
These people...

153
00:08:09,510 --> 00:08:14,510
Yes, they're people I know,
people who know me.

154
00:08:14,590 --> 00:08:17,050
I see. This is all part of my world.

155
00:08:17,970 --> 00:08:19,600
What is this?

156
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:23,060
This is supposed to be my world,
but I don't really understand.

157
00:08:23,060 --> 00:08:24,980
An image from outside?

158
00:08:24,980 --> 00:08:26,360
An unpleasant image?

159
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:28,110
That's right! The enemy!

160
00:08:28,730 --> 00:08:31,150
Enemy! Enemy! Enemy! Enemy!

161
00:08:32,150 --> 00:08:35,280
Our enemies, the Angels, given
the names of heavenly beings.

162
00:08:35,740 --> 00:08:38,240
They are the targets of the Evas and Nerv.

163
00:08:39,040 --> 00:08:41,160
The object of revenge for Miss Misato's father!

164
00:08:41,830 --> 00:08:45,460
Why do I fight despite all I've been put through?

165
00:08:45,710 --> 00:08:47,500
What are you, stupid?

166
00:08:47,540 --> 00:08:50,250
Strange beings are attacking us.

167
00:08:50,300 --> 00:08:53,670
If you're going through a fire, you've got to
brush away the embers, of course!

168
00:08:54,090 --> 00:08:56,550
Maybe I don't need a reason.

169
00:08:56,550 --> 00:08:58,720
Maybe I'm not supposed to think about it.

170
00:08:58,760 --> 00:09:02,020
Enemy! Enemy! Enemy! Enemy!

171
00:09:02,020 --> 00:09:03,520
They're all my enemies!

172
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:07,190
Those that threaten me... us...
they are the enemy.

173
00:09:07,190 --> 00:09:11,820
That's right! What's wrong with
protecting my life, our lives?!

174
00:09:11,860 --> 00:09:13,820
Enemy! Enemy! Enemy! Enemy!

175
00:09:13,900 --> 00:09:15,950
My enemy! My enemy!

176
00:09:19,990 --> 00:09:22,950
Damn! Damn! Damn!

177
00:09:22,950 --> 00:09:26,040
How dare you hurt Toji and kill my mother!

178
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:26,870
Father!

179
00:09:37,180 --> 00:09:39,470
Why do you hate your father?

180
00:09:39,470 --> 00:09:42,470
Of course! Anyone would.

181
00:09:42,470 --> 00:09:44,520
You can't understand your father?

182
00:09:44,520 --> 00:09:47,650
Of course not. I've hardly ever seen him.

183
00:09:48,060 --> 00:09:49,650
Is that why you hate him?

184
00:09:49,650 --> 00:09:54,400
Yes, my father doesn't need me!
My father deserted me!

185
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:56,240
And am I the substitute?

186
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:58,700
That's right! That's got to be it!

187
00:09:58,700 --> 00:10:01,410
He abandoned me because he had you!

188
00:10:01,410 --> 00:10:03,700
As if you didn't run away all by yourself.

189
00:10:03,740 --> 00:10:06,410
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

190
00:10:04,290 --> 00:10:04,330
Rei Ayanami

191
00:10:04,330 --> 00:10:04,370
Gendo Ikari

192
00:10:04,370 --> 00:10:04,410
Yui Ikari

193
00:10:04,410 --> 00:10:04,450
Father

194
00:10:04,450 --> 00:10:04,500
Mother

195
00:10:04,500 --> 00:10:04,540
Child

196
00:10:04,540 --> 00:10:04,580
Stranger

197
00:10:04,580 --> 00:10:04,660
Self

198
00:10:04,660 --> 00:10:04,790
The Ego

199
00:10:04,790 --> 00:10:04,830
Hypocrisy

200
00:10:04,830 --> 00:10:04,870
Needs

201
00:10:04,870 --> 00:10:04,910
Repression

202
00:10:04,910 --> 00:10:04,950
The Weak

203
00:10:04,950 --> 00:10:05,000
Identification

204
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:05,040
Self

205
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:05,080
Internalization

206
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:05,120
Breasts

207
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:05,160
Inferiority Complex

208
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:05,200
Will

209
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:05,290
Symbiosis

210
00:10:05,290 --> 00:10:05,330
Solitude

211
00:10:05,330 --> 00:10:05,370
Compensation

212
00:10:05,370 --> 00:10:05,450
Reality

213
00:10:05,450 --> 00:10:05,500
Ideal

214
00:10:05,500 --> 00:10:05,540
Inculcation

215
00:10:05,540 --> 00:10:05,620
Mind and Body

216
00:10:05,620 --> 00:10:05,660
Fear

217
00:10:05,660 --> 00:10:05,700
Insecurity

218
00:10:05,700 --> 00:10:05,750
Value

219
00:10:05,750 --> 00:10:05,830
Dependence

220
00:10:05,830 --> 00:10:05,870
Escape

221
00:10:05,870 --> 00:10:05,910
Estrangement

222
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:05,960
Loss

223
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:06,000
Oral Stage

224
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:06,040
Obsession

225
00:10:06,410 --> 00:10:08,620
It's all his fault!!

226
00:10:08,620 --> 00:10:11,590
That time, I was actually going
to tell him I hate him!

227
00:10:09,130 --> 00:10:09,380
Come.
Gendo lkari

228
00:10:11,340 --> 00:10:11,590
Welcome to
Nerv

229
00:10:15,420 --> 00:10:19,180
Are you telling me to get on that thing
and put myself in danger, Father?

230
00:10:19,180 --> 00:10:20,140
Correct.

231
00:10:20,140 --> 00:10:23,720
What's with that?! I don't want to!
Why are you saying this now?!

232
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:26,480
I thought you didn't need me, Father!

233
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:28,770
I merely called you because I needed you.

234
00:10:30,230 --> 00:10:32,440
Why me?

235
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:34,650
Because it's impossible for anyone else.

236
00:10:35,860 --> 00:10:38,070
But that's impossible.

237
00:10:38,070 --> 00:10:41,530
I've never even seen or heard of it.
There's no way I could do it!

238
00:10:42,620 --> 00:10:44,950
No, I knew.

239
00:10:44,950 --> 00:10:47,910
That's right! I knew the Eva.

240
00:10:48,210 --> 00:10:51,000
And that time, I ran away!

241
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,170
Away from Mother and Father!

242
00:11:00,970 --> 00:11:03,760
Current LCL temperature
holding steady at 36 degrees.

243
00:11:03,760 --> 00:11:05,510
No problem with oxygen concentration.

244
00:11:05,510 --> 00:11:08,730
Electromagnetic radiation pulse is normal.
Wave pattern is B.

245
00:11:08,730 --> 00:11:11,230
All instrumentation is functioning normally.

246
00:11:11,900 --> 00:11:14,270
OPERATION PLAN

247
00:11:11,900 --> 00:11:14,270
TYPE EP2 SALVAGE WORK PROCEDURAL OUTLINE
(AND TYPE LP3 COMPLEMENTATION PROCEDURE)

248
00:11:11,900 --> 00:11:14,650
Salvage Plan Outline...

249
00:11:14,650 --> 00:11:18,240
Only you could have created
all this in just one month.

250
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:20,990
Unfortunately, I didn't come up with the idea.

251
00:11:20,990 --> 00:11:23,410
It's data from experiments
completed ten years ago.

252
00:11:23,410 --> 00:11:26,910
This kind of thing happened
during the Eva's development?

253
00:11:26,910 --> 00:11:29,500
It was before I worked here.

254
00:11:29,500 --> 00:11:33,380
It seems my mother was here,
but I only know the data.

255
00:11:33,380 --> 00:11:36,000
And how did it come out back then?

256
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,250
I heard they failed.

257
00:11:42,550 --> 00:11:44,260
Kindness...

258
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:46,600
Warmth...

259
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:49,020
Is this the warmth of a human?

