530
00:20:18,230 --> 00:20:19,780
You really are just like my father.

531
00:20:21,570 --> 00:20:24,160
I didn't know you still smoked.

532
00:20:24,610 --> 00:20:27,370
I only smoke after this sort of thing.

533
00:20:27,660 --> 00:20:30,410
So nobody knows but you.

534
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:33,670
Well, I'm honored.

535
00:20:34,250 --> 00:20:39,550
So, how far has the Human
Instrumentality Project gotten?

536
00:20:40,090 --> 00:20:42,170
Adam, destroyer of humanity.

537
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:44,890
Why is it being kept underground?

538
00:20:45,800 --> 00:20:48,930
Are you seeing me because
you want to know that?

539
00:20:50,220 --> 00:20:52,640
Well, that's one of the reasons, to be honest.

540
00:20:53,770 --> 00:20:57,060
I'm most honored to be used by a lady,

541
00:20:57,060 --> 00:20:59,020
but I can't tell you in a place like this.

542
00:20:59,020 --> 00:21:01,900
All I care about right now is for you
to understand what I want.

543
00:21:02,360 --> 00:21:06,870
What is Nerv's and Commander Ikari's
true objective?

544
00:21:07,320 --> 00:21:09,370
I'd like to know that myself.

545
00:21:14,870 --> 00:21:18,960
Hey, don't dodge my questions by doing that!

546
00:21:46,570 --> 00:21:48,110
Hey, no!

547
00:21:48,110 --> 00:21:50,030
Don't put strange things in there!

548
00:21:50,950 --> 00:21:53,500
What are you doing at a time like this?
What's that?

549
00:21:53,500 --> 00:21:56,080
A present for you, the first in eight years.

550
00:21:57,420 --> 00:21:59,290
Though it may be the last.

551
00:21:59,330 --> 00:22:00,880
TO BE CONTINUED

